WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.885
We will start with ordinary CTEs because they make
complex queries easier to read Then

00:00:06.911 --> 00:00:12.502
we will introduce recursive CTEs for hierarchies
After that

00:00:12.726 --> 00:00:18.725
we will study the OVER clause and window functions
Ranking and sequence functions

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:25.427
come next Then we will make frames explicit Finally

00:00:25.664 --> 00:00:29.558
we will combine CTEs and windows into useful
analytical patterns
